abItem subTabItem\"><a href=\"/vn/keyboards/keyboards/pbt-keycaps/rog-azoth-extreme-edition-20/overview/rog-edition-20/\" target=\"_self\">\n                  Rog Edition 20\n                </a></li></ul></li> <li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Thông số kỹ thuật\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS ProductTabBar__active__N4qFo\"><span>\n                Giải thưởng\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Thư viện\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Nơi mua\n              </span></li><li tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"tabItem ProductTabBar__mobileTabItem__KF1TS\"><span>\n                Hỗ trợ\n              </span></li></ul></div></div> <!----> <div class=\"ProductAwards__productAwardPage__DePl3\"><!----> <div class=\"ProductAwards__awardTabs__2vloX\"><ul role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Awards, Meidas, and Videos\" style=\"width:1520px;\"><li aria-selected=\"true\" aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Awards, Meidas, and Videos\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards tabpanel-video tabpanel-media\" id=\"All\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ ProductAwards__active__9TvSy\">\n          All\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Giải thưởng\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards\" id=\"Giải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:none;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(6)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202609211923323410503.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      igorslab.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      At the end of the day, in my opinion, the Azoth Extreme Edition 20, like its predecessor, belongs to the best that a large and broadly positioned hardware manufacturer has so far brought to market in the keyboard sector, initially considered independently of the high price. The custom keyboard scene is expressly not taken into account in this assessment.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>09/11/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.igorslab.de/asus-rog-azoth-extreme-edition-20-im-test-high-end-tastatur-mit-goldakzenten-zum-rog-jubilaeum-in-progress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202402131957165300190.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"95%\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Gamepress.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>95%</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 and Harpe II Extreme Edition 20 represent a pair of premium peripherals targeting gamers and enthusiasts looking for absolute quality and maximum possible collectible value. The Azoth Extreme keyboard offers top-tier dampening, perfectly tuned switches, and a luxurious construction, while the Harpe II Extreme scores with an extremely low weight, precise sensor, and instantaneous response.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>08/02/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of 95%\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://gamepress.cz/recenze-asus-rog-azoth-rog-harpe-ii-extreme-edition-20/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1250/202607131553423560030.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC Ekspert\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      All connections work very well and we spent 50% of the time in wireless mode and 50% in wired mode; we noticed no difference, and the SpeedNova connection with the booster is something even eSports players can use.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CROATIA</span> <span>07/31/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Recommended award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://pcekspert.com/clanak/asus-rog-azoth-extreme-edition-20-recenzija/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202609161633195810873.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Extraordinary award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      SS MODS\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Extraordinary award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The best and most modern technology that can be built in is right here, while the build quality and materials are second to none.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>09/26/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Extraordinary award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://ss-mods.com/asus-rog-azoth-extreme-edition-20-tastatura-bez-cenzure/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202004030041092950759.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Advanced design award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC AXE\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Advanced design award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The keyboard utilizes a carbon fiber positioning plate, an adjustable gasket system, and a full-color OLED screen, providing a premium typing feel, rich customization options, and collectible value. The wrist rest is rubberized and pleasant to use, leaves no fingerprints, and all components are crafted with maximum comfort and aesthetics in mind.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>06/25/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Advanced design award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://axe.rs/hardver/periferije/asus-rog-azoth-extreme-edition-20/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202607031843488390384.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Advanced design award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Streberi\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Advanced design award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The internal construction is designed to eliminate side-to-side key movement — there is no wobbling, no instability, every click is clean and stable, and the factory-applied lubricant further enhances this. Wireless via RF behaves as if it were wired: there is no latency, no lag, and the response is instantaneous.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>06/17/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Keyboard Media review Award of Advanced design award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.streberi.rs/rog-azoth-extreme-edition-20-recenzija-vredi-li-600/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoWrapper__-NXix\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewTitle__0lBVH\" style=\"display:;\"><h2 class=\"pageVideo vnRogFont ProductAwardVideo__vnRogFontSize__n4Ouu\">Video review</h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(12)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContentScroll__+rpKV\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoContainer__SWxvv\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"the mo